      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAGIC WYLDE (1) comes off an average performance last start when fifth at this track over 400m behind Tornado Ethics (22.99) in a Grade 4/5. Placed at his previous run. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Can make amends. HEY MICKEY (8) has been close to a win, finishing in the minors six on end before a fourth when made contact with another runner last time in a Mix 1/2/3 at this track (23.51). Speedy runner who can find the front with a clear break from out wide. Rates a key player and gets chance to atone. STOCK'S GIFT (2) hasn't been far away, finishing in the money twice in a row including last time in a Grade 5 at The Gardens over 400m. Can turn it around this time. BUMPY BLUE (3) is always a threat when she races at this track and distance.",
